<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Feb 12 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Feb 12 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED FEBRUARY 12</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............796,800 up.....2,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......705,300 down.....500</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......531,800 .........400</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....812,606 down.....115</p>
<p> Financial companies.......627,679 up.....1,670</p>
<p> New York business loans....43,842 down.....356</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......43,606 down.....359</p>
</text>
